004--2007, WNV had appeared to reach a stable incidence of approximately 0.4 per 100,000\"}]}], \"methods_quotes\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Using the 386 reported neuroinvasive disease cases, CDC estimated that 54,000 infections\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"for every case of WNV neuroinvasive disease there are approximately 140 infections\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"based on July 1, 2009 U.S. Census population estimates\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}